   - Returns a fully populated Sale entity with all calculated values

The implementation uses the ExplainableQueryTracker to build up LINQ queries with explanations, which will help with debugging and understanding the calculation logic. All calculations are done as LINQ expressions that will be translated to SQL and executed on the database server, avoiding the need to materialize collections with ToList().
